```

### Key dimensions (verified by hook)

```
col_embedder output: (B, T, F+C, 128)  = (1, 105, 34, 128)
  B = 1 (ensemble batch)
  T = 105 (100 train + 5 test)
  F+C = 34 (30 features + 4 CLS tokens)
  128 = embed_dim

row_interactor output: (B, T, 512)
  512 = embed_dim(128) × num_cls(4)
```

